:HELP NAME=STRDFU.Start DFU (STRDFU)
:P.The Start DFU (STRDFU) command works with the Data File Utility's
menu, or one of its options.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRDFU/OPTION'.Option (OPTION)
:P.The option for this command.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *SELECT.
:P.The value must be 1, 2, 3, 4, 5.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='STRDFU/DFUPGM'.DFU program (DFUPGM)
:P.The DFU program for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
